      "title": "📋 Instructions",
      "properties": {},
      "widgets_values": [
        "## 🎬 Stixx Stories — Batch Image Generator\n\n### How to Use This Workflow\n\n**Step 1:** Place your text file in ComfyUI's `input` folder\n\n**Step 2:** In the **Load Text File** node, select your `.txt` file\n\n**Step 3:** Set the **Batch Count** in the queue to match the number of lines\n\n**Step 4:** Click **Queue Prompt** — each run reads the next line!\n\n---\n\n### Text File Format\n```\n00:00 - Early humans on the African savanna\n00:05 - A caveman discovering fire\n00:10 - Two stick figures trading goods\n```\n\nOR simply:\n```\nEarly humans on the African savanna\nA caveman discovering fire\nTwo stick figures trading goods\n```\n\n---\n\n### 🐍 Python Script (Recommended)\n\nFor fully automated batch processing, use:\n```\npython batch_generate.py -i prompts.txt\n```\n\nThe Python script:\n- Reads each line from your text file\n- Wraps it in the Stixx Stories style prompt\n- Sends to ComfyUI API automatically\n- Waits for each image before next\n- Names files: stixx_stories_0001_00_00.png\n\n---\n\n### Style: Stixx Stories\n- Simple stick figures with round white heads\n- Bold black ink outlines, dot eyes\n- Richly painted scenic backgrounds\n- Warm earth tones, painterly brushwork\n- Cinematic 16:9 compositions\n\n### Model Files Required\n- `z_image_turbo_bf16.safetensors` → diffusion_models/\n- `qwen_3_4b.safetensors` → text_encoders/\n- `ae.safetensors` → vae/\n\n### Custom Nodes Required\n- **pysssss/ComfyUI-Custom-Scripts** (for LoadText and StringFunction nodes)\n- Install via ComfyUI Manager\n"
      ],
      "color": "#222",
      "bgcolor": "#000"
    }
